+  /// Play/pause, and on a TV also hand focus to the on-screen controls.
+  ///
+  /// A remote has no pointer, so without this the panel's buttons are reachable
+  /// only if the user happens to press the right arrow at the right time. This
+  /// makes play/pause the documented way in: one press toggles playback and
